      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://userimg-assets.customeriomail.com/images/client-env-158749/1747884409611_Email%20Banner%201.1%20from%20Victor_1747884399_01JVV0F0W43DY0RT2H605TF0N1.png" alt="Our commitment to you" width="500px"/>
        </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
            <mj-text>
                Our care, our priority. Our promise is to ensure that your journey to better health is supported by comprehensive, reliable, and services. In addition to connecting you with licensed providers and accredited pharmacies, for your treatments, we go above and beyond to ensure:
            </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    
    <mj-section border="1px solid #e6d7cb" border-radius="20px" background-color="#faf7f5"padding="16px">
  <mj-column width="80px" vertical-align="middle">
    <mj-image align="left" padding="0"
      src="https://assets.parceldns.com/assets/cd659c3a-1731-4082-9954-786fb79fff87/b502ef26-36a1-40e1-9c62-8d9858eb233f.png?parcelPath=/Assets/email-12-1.png"
      alt=""
      width="60px"/>
  </mj-column>
  <mj-column width="350px" vertical-align="middle">
    <mj-text 
      padding="0"
      font-size="16px"
      font-weight="700">
      <span style="color:#4c7a39;">Included</span> Consultations
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text 
      padding="10px 0 0"
      font-size="14px">
      Online consultations with your doctor are part of your membership, so you can adjust your dose as needed with pricing that stays flat and predictable at every dose.
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
<mj-section padding="0 0 16px"/>
    <mj-section border="1px solid #e6d7cb" border-radius="20px" background-color="#faf7f5"padding="16px">
        <mj-column width="80px" vertical-align="middle">
            <mj-image align="left" padding="0" src="https://assets.parceldns.com/assets/cd659c3a-1731-4082-9954-786fb79fff87/b502ef26-36a1-40e1-9c62-8d9858eb233f.png?parcelPath=/Assets/email-12-1.png" alt="" width="60px"/>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="350px" vertical-align="middle">
            <mj-text font-size="16px" font-weight="700" padding="0">
            <span style="color:#4c7a39;">24/7</span> Support Availability
            </mj-text>
            <mj-text font-size="14px" padding="10px 0 0">
                Our care team is here whenever you need us, so support is always within reach throughout your journey.
            </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section padding="0 0 16px"/>
    <mj-section border="1px solid #e6d7cb" border-radius="20px" background-color="#faf7f5"padding="16px">
