            <mj-image align="left" padding="0" src="https://assets.parceldns.com/assets/cd659c3a-1731-4082-9954-786fb79fff87/b502ef26-36a1-40e1-9c62-8d9858eb233f.png?parcelPath=/Assets/email-12-1.png" alt="" width="60px"/>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="350px" vertical-align="middle">
            <mj-text font-size="16px" font-weight="700" padding="0">Comprehensive <span style="color:#4c7a39;">Support Channels</span>
            </mj-text>
            <mj-text font-size="14px" padding="10px 0 0">
                From chat to check-ins, we make it easy to reach your care team across multiple channels so you always have the guidance you need.
            </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
            <mj-button>
                Get Started
            </mj-button>
        </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
            <mj-text font-size="14px" align="center">
                *A physician reviews your intake often within 24 hours. In most states, this is done asynchronously without having to schedule an appointment.
            </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
            <mj-text font-size="12px" align="center" line-height="1.5" font-family="Open Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif">
                Prescription required. FDA does not approve compounded drugs for safety or efficacy. See website for <a style="color:black" href="https://www.eden.health/safety-info">safety information</a>. Eden does not provide medical services. Medical services are provided through a contracted network of state-licensed physicians who may prescribe treatments as needed to meet patient requirements. Not all programs and services are available in all 50 states. Plans are offered as a subscription service, which can be canceled at any time. Actual product packaging may appear differently than shown. Results may vary based on individual health factors.
            </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
